# R110-189 — MQ Hardening Phase 2: 15 additional defects in dev_message_queue

Follows R110-188 (11 user-flagged P1/P2/P3 defects, all pushed 8c21885).
This directive covers 15 ADDITIONAL defects surfaced by deeper analysis
that were NOT in the original 11 — R110-188 was strictly bounded to
the user-confirmed set. User has now requested full coverage of all 15.

User-confirmed scope (2026-08-18): "1 alle" = all 15 below. None are
"nice to have". Each is cited with code location and resulting fix.

